{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' solver_index.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L4--7 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: enter_displayed_pattern, repeat_key\n- L10--12 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: enter_displayed_pattern, repeat_key\n- L15--20 `def play_level_3(env):`; calls: enter_displayed_pattern, repeat_key\n- L23--26 `def play_level_4(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_sc25_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_uize5e8`\n- L29--41 `def play_level_5(env):`; calls: activate_palette_pattern, repeat_key\n\n## legs.py\n- L5--11 `def repeat_key(env, key, count):` — Apply a bounded run of one key, stopping when the level changes.; calls: range, safe_step\n- L14--23 `def enter_displayed_pattern(env, ink=15):` — Copy the displayed 3x3 glyph into its adjacent clickable grid.; calls: arr, int, range, safe_step\n- L26--36 `def activate_palette_pattern(env, x, y):` — Select a palette glyph and complete its zero-colour input stencil.; calls: arr, int, range, safe_step\n\n## perception.py\n- L23--36 `class Blob:`; calls: dataclass\n- L39--40 `def arr(frame) -> np.ndarray:`\n- L43--45 `def color_counts(frame) -> Dict[int, int]:`; calls: arr, int, zip\n- L48--79 `def connected_components(frame, colors: Optional[Iterable[int]] = None, min_area: int = 1) -> List[Blob]:`; calls: Blob, arr, int, len, max, min, range, sorted, sum\n- L82--89 `def block_signatures(frame, cell: int = 4) -> Dict[Tuple[int, int], Tuple[int, ...]]:` — Partition a frame into fixed cells and return each cell's color signature.; calls: arr, int, range, sorted, tuple\n- L92--110 `def object_candidates(frame, cell: int = 4, min_area: int = 4) -> List[dict]:` — A compact,